30	     * whitespace collapsed, upper-cased, and common street-type abbreviations expanded. Returns the
31	     * empty string for a null or blank input. Shared with {@link CheckOwnerHouseholdUnique} and
32	     * {@link AssignOwnerHousehold} so the request side, the household duplicate check and the shared
33	     * household id are all compared on identical normalized text.
